      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that you aren't a doctor but i'm just trying to understand what might be happening. if i don't have any weakness in my arms or legs and my speech is totally fine, doesn't that pretty much rule out a stroke? like, if it's just the facial drooping, isn't that more typical of bells palsy? it feels like a lot of trouble to go to the er just for a facial twitch or something.",
